// State for back/drive/sink/notes.id's own cases -- filed here because
// every directory near notes.id and utnote's own declaration
// (mid/names/limits/shape/cases/report/host/mark/init.id) is already at the
// since-dropped 3-entry limit. notes_base alone is the "nothing to report" case
// (utnote exported but empty); notes_setup adds one note to it.

notes_base() {
  env_init();
  init_rtc();
  ut_mark();
} return void;
